@page "/"

<PageTitle>BevTools samples</PageTitle>

<h1>BevTools samples</h1>

<p>
    The same pages in every hosting model: Blazor Server, WebAssembly, Interactive Auto and Blazor Hybrid (MAUI).
    Press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>D</kbd> or click the badge in the corner to open BevTools, then use the
    pages below and watch the panel named next to each one.
</p>

<p class="status">
    Rendered by <strong>@RendererInfo.Name</strong> (@(RendererInfo.IsInteractive ? "interactive" : "prerendering")).
</p>

<section>
    <h2>Counter</h2>
    <p>Every click is a UI event that renders this page: <em>Components → Rendering</em> and <em>Profiler</em> say why.</p>
    <button @onclick="() => _count++">Clicked @_count times</button>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Pages</h2>
    <ul class="pages">
        <li><NavLink href="components">Components</NavLink>: parameters, child events and a timer; <em>Components</em>, <em>Profiler</em>, <em>Timeline</em>.</li>
        <li><NavLink href="state">State</NavLink>: a state provider, a form and redacted values; <em>State</em>, <em>Forms</em>, <em>Routing</em>.</li>
        <li><NavLink href="network">Network</NavLink>: requests through <code>IHttpClientFactory</code>; <em>Network</em>, <em>Diagnostics</em>.</li>
        <li><NavLink href="interop">JS interop</NavLink>: calls in both directions; <em>JS Interop</em>, <em>Diagnostics</em>.</li>
        <li><NavLink href="errors">Errors</NavLink>: an error a component throws and errors nobody catches; <em>Errors</em>, <em>Diagnostics</em>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The <em>Services</em>, <em>Runtime</em> and <em>About</em> panels describe the host itself, whatever page is open.</p>
</section>

@code {
    private int _count;
}
